#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:958
msgid ""
"How long listings stay active and whether business owners can claim "
"existing entries."
msgstr ""
"Wie lange Listings aktiv bleiben und ob Geschäftsinhaber vorhandene "
"Einträge beanspruchen können."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:963
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:966
msgid "Listing expiration"
msgstr "Listing-Ablauf"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:970
msgid "Enable automatic listing expiration"
msgstr "Aktiviere automatische Listing-Ablauf"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:973
msgid ""
"Off by default — most directories keep listings lifetime. Turn on only for "
"classifieds, job posts, event rentals, or other time-bound niches. When "
"enabled, listings auto-unpublish after the default expiration period and "
"reminder emails go out 7 days and 1 day before expiry."
msgstr ""
"Standardmäßig aus — die meisten Verzeichnisse behalten Listings lebenslang. "
"Aktiviere nur für Kleinanzeigen, Stellenausschreibungen, "
"Veranstaltungsmieten oder andere zeitgebundene Nischen. Wenn aktiviert, "
"werden Listings nach dem Standardablauf automatisch unveröffentlicht und "
"Erinnerungs-E-Mails gehen 7 Tage und 1 Tag vor Ablauf aus."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:977
msgid "Default expiration"
msgstr "Standardablauf"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:980
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:996
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1356
msgid "days"
msgstr "Tage"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:981
msgid ""
"Days before a new listing expires. Leave at 0 for lifetime listings (the "
"directory default). Plans (Pro) override this per plan."
msgstr ""
"Tage, bevor ein neues Listing abläuft. Lasse auf 0 für Listings mit "
"lebenslanger Gültigkeit (Verzeichnis-Standard). Pläne (Pro) setzen dies pro "
"Plan außer Kraft."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:985
msgid "Renewal window"
msgstr "Erneuerungsfenster"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:988
msgid "days before expiry"
msgstr "Tage vor Ablauf"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:989
msgid ""
"How many days before expiry users can start renewing. Already-expired "
"listings can always renew."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele Tage vor Ablauf Benutzer mit der Erneuerung beginnen können. "
"Bereits abgelaufene Listings können jederzeit erneuern."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:993
msgid "Renewal duration"
msgstr "Erneuerungsdauer"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:997
msgid ""
"Default extension applied when a listing is renewed. Set to 0 to use the "
"standard listing expiration period. Pricing plans (Pro) override this per "
"plan."
msgstr ""
"Standarderweiterung, die angewendet wird, wenn ein Listing erneuert wird. "
"Lasse auf 0, um den Standard-Listing-Ablaufzeitraum zu verwenden. "
"Preispläne (Pro) setzen dies pro Plan außer Kraft."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1001
msgid "Renewal cost"
msgstr "Erneuerungskosten"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1004
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1324
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1340
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1398
msgid "credits"
msgstr "Credits"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1005
msgid ""
"Default credit cost for renewals. Set to 0 for free renewals. Plans (Pro) "
"override this per plan."
msgstr ""
"Standard-Kreditkosten für Erneuerungen. Lasse auf 0 für kostenlose "
"Erneuerungen. Pläne (Pro) setzen dies pro Plan außer Kraft."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1025
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1034
