msgstr "Angebotseinreichung"

#: includes/class-features.php:55
msgid ""
"Allow visitors and members to submit new listings from the frontend "
"submission form."
msgstr ""
"Erlaube Besuchern und Mitgliedern, neue Angebote über das "
"Frontend-Einreichungsformular einzureichen."

#: includes/class-features.php:62
msgid "Reviews & Ratings"
msgstr "Bewertungen & Ratings"

#: includes/class-features.php:63
msgid "Enable star ratings and review submissions on listing detail pages."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviere Sternenbewertungen und Bewertungseinreichungen auf "
"Angebotsdetailseiten."

#: includes/class-features.php:70
msgid "Business Claims"
msgstr "Geschäftsansprüche"

#: includes/class-features.php:71
msgid "Allow business owners to claim ownership of unverified listings."
msgstr ""
"Erlaube Geschäftsinhabern, Eigentümerschaft unverifizierter Angebote zu "
"beanspruchen."

#: includes/class-features.php:78 templates/blocks/user-dashboard/nav.php:69
#: src/blocks/user-dashboard/index.js:35
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "Favoriten"

#: includes/class-features.php:79
msgid "Let logged-in users save listings to a personal favorites list."
msgstr ""
"Erlaube angemeldeten Benutzern, Angebote in einer persönlichen "
"Favoritenliste zu speichern."

#: includes/class-features.php:86
msgid "Listing Renewal"
msgstr "Angebotsverlängerung"

#: includes/class-features.php:87
msgid "Allow listing owners to renew expired listings from their dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Erlaube Angebotsbesitzern, abgelaufene Angebote von ihrem Dashboard aus zu "
"verlängern."

#: includes/class-features.php:94
msgid "Report Listings"
msgstr "Angebote melden"

#: includes/class-features.php:95
msgid ""
"Let visitors flag inaccurate, spam, closed, or inappropriate listings for "
"admin review."
msgstr ""
"Erlaube Besuchern, ungenaue, Spam-, geschlossene oder unangemessene "
"Angebote zur Überprüfung durch den Administrator zu kennzeichnen."

#: includes/class-features.php:103
msgid "Schema.org JSON-LD"
msgstr "Schema.org JSON-LD"

#: includes/class-features.php:104
msgid ""
"Output structured data on listing pages (LocalBusiness, AggregateRating, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Gib strukturierte Daten auf Angebotsseiten aus (LocalBusiness, "
"AggregateRating usw.)."

#: includes/class-features.php:111
msgid "Open Graph + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "Open Graph + Twitter Cards"

#: includes/class-features.php:112
msgid ""
"Generate social sharing meta tags so listings preview nicely on Facebook, "
"Twitter/X, LinkedIn."
msgstr ""
"Generiere Social-Sharing-Meta-Tags, damit Angebote auf Facebook, Twitter/X "
"und LinkedIn schön in der Vorschau angezeigt werden."

#: includes/class-features.php:119
msgid "Breadcrumbs"
msgstr "Breadcrumbs"

#: includes/class-features.php:120
msgid ""
"Show breadcrumb navigation on listing detail pages with BreadcrumbList "
"schema."
msgstr ""
"Zeige Breadcrumb-Navigation auf Angebotsdetailseiten mit "
"BreadcrumbList-Schema."

#: includes/class-features.php:127
msgid "Sitemap (XML)"
msgstr "Sitemap (XML)"

#: includes/class-features.php:128
msgid "Add listings to the XML sitemap so search engines can discover them."
msgstr "Füge Angebote zur XML-Sitemap hinzu, damit Suchmaschinen sie finden können."

#: includes/class-plugin.php:790
msgid ""
"This listing has expired and may no longer be accurate. Please contact the "
"listing owner for current information."
msgstr ""
"Dieses Angebot ist abgelaufen und ist möglicherweise nicht mehr genau. "
"Bitte kontaktiere den Angebotsbesitzer für aktuelle Informationen."

